id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lSwPJt2ZPX03tEpfXE1BFw","review_id":"gd60zdwNbPj_GDyEEGDZwg","date":"2017-10-23T06:11:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9459517002105713,"text_excerpt":"This was my first visit to New Orleans Cake Cafe & Bakery as I'd never heard of it and it was recommended to me by a local. So, I'm asking myself now ... how the heck did I miss this place before on my visits to NOLA? The location is unassuming and if you blink, you might miss the sign outside. However, as this place was busy, busy, busy ... I don't think a lot of people miss it! Luckily, we hit it a very small \"slow window\" as it was pouring rain and braved it to go inside. It was packed inside but there wasn't a line to order ... which you do at the counter and then they will seat you and bring your food out. Be warned, there are goodies to behold in the counter as you order. My sister ..."},{"business_id":"lSwPJt2ZPX03tEpfXE1BFw","review_id":"X6P8RxteYZrHpCmCEWY9Bg","date":"2019-01-27T18:43:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9434658288955688,"text_excerpt":"New Orleans Cake Cafe and Bakery is fantastic. I doubt I would have ever found this place if my daughter's friend, who hails from New Orleans, hadn't recommended it to us. We walked to it from the French Quarter, giving us a chance to see a neighborhood and not just our touristy home base. It was warm enough to sit outside and the friendly staff ensured we got menus right away. So hard to choose!! You order inside -- I went for the corned beef hash and my kids had the breakfast sandwich, fresh bagel with cream cheese and lox and a mushroom gravy and biscuit meal that I think was a special. Everything was tasty and made from quality ingredients. We got a cupcake to go, which we enjoyed lat..."},{"business_id":"lSwPJt2ZPX03tEpfXE1BFw","review_id":"OXjBgK8t_EdYx-ALfDlTdQ","date":"2013-09-13T17:31:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385943412780762,"text_excerpt":"Mmm, Cake Cafe. I have so many wonderful things to say about this place. For starters, they have the nicest, sweetest staff I have ever encountered!! Almost as soon as you enter you stand in line and someone immediately gives you a menu, and asks where you would like to sit and while you order, they find you a table. They offer a lot of specials and these continue to change with what's in season, which I love. There are so many good options here it's hard to pick favorites off the menu, just order what you you're in the mood for or craving and you won't be disappointed. Their biscuits are huge with tons of soft, buttery layers and are the best that I've gotten in the city, truly handmade ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lSwPJt2ZPX03tEpfXE1BFw","photo_id":"zyBJazURHTJC4Aio3JKuug","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zyBJazURHTJC4Aio3JKuug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8541452884674072},{"business_id":"lSwPJt2ZPX03tEpfXE1BFw","photo_id":"WdWM0hQcaQXXxS70b9Q_EA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WdWM0hQcaQXXxS70b9Q_EA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8394539952278137},{"business_id":"lSwPJt2ZPX03tEpfXE1BFw","photo_id":"ty-6qHPDeiLmBalXAgsWuA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ty-6qHPDeiLmBalXAgsWuA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8324722051620483},{"business_id":"lSwPJt2ZPX03tEpfXE1BFw","photo_id":"Wck-2IdS3hMGgIf69sz2PA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Wck-2IdS3hMGgIf69sz2PA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7644286751747131},{"business_id":"lSwPJt2ZPX03tEpfXE1BFw","photo_id":"pG-hOu7GxLg6CUuthD13-A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pG-hOu7GxLg6CUuthD13-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6505284309387207}]},"notebook_case":null}
